    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orchid Glitter is late 2000s style 2d shmups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just a bullet-hell shooter where you dodge bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game design also includes features like eliminating bullets with charge attacks, and earning points and resources by taking dangerous actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c7 GAME SYSTEM / ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a standard play-through bullet hell STG, an old-style game in which you play all five stages (planned) in succession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also includes a practice mode where you can play just each stage (planned!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c7 Game System / Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3007 MainShot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570590/extras/4493dc4fc2e53732c345c6abdf8c8f52.avif?t=1741620153\" width=690 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main shot is a standard weapon. It can be fired infinitely without any remaining bullets. It can fire two different types of shots, Wide and Narrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wide shot has low power, but has a strong charge recovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrow shot has a little more firepower, but has a short range and little charge recovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3007 Burst</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570590/extras/2db8e18e9af575e52af7aafe08c0a79f.avif?t=1741620153\" width=678 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bursts are powerful attacks that consume the charge gauge. You are invincible while they are activated, and they have great firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can fill up the charge gauge by defeating enemies or firing shots, and they encourage dangerous actions with close-range bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can earn a lot of charge gauge if you try. Recharge it a lot and dominate the field with powerful bursts in succession!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c7Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3007KAI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl with cat ears. She pilots the &quot;Orchid Glitter,&quot; a fighter plane that operates according to unknown physical laws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570590/extras/4181d0393ad162e15e2f36e9b772f60e.avif?t=1741620153\" width=150 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Character design is commissioned by  kinutani yutaka )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3007RENN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A personality-equipped support system for the fighter jet, &quot;Orchid Glitter.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570590/extras/1e19e746e348d241527823469ad84ca4.avif?t=1741620153\" width=154 height=188 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orchid Glitter is late 2000s style 2d shmups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just a bullet-hell shooter where you dodge bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game design also includes features like eliminating bullets with charge attacks, and earning points and resources by taking dangerous actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c7 GAME SYSTEM / ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a standard play-through bullet hell STG, an old-style game in which you play all five stages (planned) in succession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also includes a practice mode where you can play just each stage (planned!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c7 Game System / Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3007 MainShot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570590/extras/4493dc4fc2e53732c345c6abdf8c8f52.avif?t=1741620153\" width=690 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main shot is a standard weapon. It can be fired infinitely without any remaining bullets. It can fire two different types of shots, Wide and Narrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wide shot has low power, but has a strong charge recovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrow shot has a little more firepower, but has a short range and little charge recovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3007 Burst</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570590/extras/2db8e18e9af575e52af7aafe08c0a79f.avif?t=1741620153\" width=678 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bursts are powerful attacks that consume the charge gauge. You are invincible while they are activated, and they have great firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can fill up the charge gauge by defeating enemies or firing shots, and they encourage dangerous actions with close-range bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can earn a lot of charge gauge if you try. Recharge it a lot and dominate the field with powerful bursts in succession!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c7Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3007KAI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl with cat ears. She pilots the &quot;Orchid Glitter,&quot; a fighter plane that operates according to unknown physical laws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570590/extras/4181d0393ad162e15e2f36e9b772f60e.avif?t=1741620153\" width=150 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Character design is commissioned by  kinutani yutaka )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3007RENN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A personality-equipped support system for the fighter jet, &quot;Orchid Glitter.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570590/extras/1e19e746e348d241527823469ad84ca4.avif?t=1741620153\" width=154 height=188 /></span></p>",
